    "result": "The average review rating for office products priced over $50 is **4.11** (4.1054, from 41,411 reviews across 1,192 items).\n\n```json\n{\n  \"answer\": 4.1054,\n  \"sql\": \"SELECT ROUND(AVG(f.rtg), 4) AS avg_rating, COUNT(*) AS n_reviews, COUNT(DISTINCT f.ref_id) AS n_items FROM fdbk_g1 f JOIN items_g1 i ON f.ref_id = i.ref_id WHERE i.prc > 50\"\n}\n```\n\nVerified assumptions:\n- **g1 = Office Products**: `taxn_g1` level-0 categories are \"Office Products\" (17,825) and \"Office Electronics\" (29).\n- **Price units**: `items_g1.prc` is in dollars (range 0.18–13,914.85 with plausible decimal prices), so the $50 threshold applies directly.\n- **Join key**: `fdbk_g1.ref_id` → `items_g1.ref_id`, per the declared FK.\n- **Ratings**: `fdbk_g1.rtg` contains only integer-valued 1.0–5.0; the average is over 41,411 individual reviews of the 1,192 items above $50.",
